===== Involved rules descriptions:

[iamf][Rule #17] id: assert-common-profile-restrictions
Section 4
Common restrictions on the IA Sequence for all profiles:
- The maximum size of an OBU SHALL be limited to 2MB.
- There SHALL be only one unique Codec Config OBU.
- num_sub_mixes SHOULD be set to 1.
- num_audio_elements SHOULD be set to at most 28.
- When num_layers = 1, both output_gain_is_present_flag and recon_gain_is_present_flag SHALL be set to 0.

[iamf][Rule #25] id: assert-aac-lc-specific
Section 3.11.2
AAC-LC Specific checks:
- codec_id SHALL be mp4a.
- objectTypeIndication SHALL be 0x40.
- streamType SHALL be 0x05 (Audio Stream).
- upstream SHALL be 0.
- audioObjectType SHALL be 2 (AAC-LC).
- channelConfiguration SHALL be 2.
- frameLengthFlag SHALL be 0 (1024 lines IMDCT).
- dependsOnCoreCoder SHALL be 0.
- extensionFlag SHALL be 0.
- num_samples_per_frame SHALL be 1024 (Section 3.5 requires it to match the decoder_config frame length, which Section 3.11.2 defines as 1024 via frameLengthFlag = 0).

